# Ignore everything
*
!.gitignore

# Except Go source files
!*.go
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Except Markdown files
!*.md

# Except the build file and the web frontend sources
# (web/main.wasm and web/wasm_exec.js are generated by `make wasm`)
!Makefile
!web/index.html
!web/app.js

# Except the GitHub Actions workflows
!.github/workflows/*.yml

# Except the fixtures required by the tests
!testdata/*.svg
!testdata/*.html
!testdata/*.txt

# Except a deck's sync state and manifest: both belong next to the sources
# they describe, and their diffs are meant to be read. A state file is named
# after the presentation it records; the bare name is the one older versions
# wrote, kept here so an existing one stays visible until it is migrated.
!.svg2gslide-*.json
!.svg2gslide.json
!deck.txt

# Except directories (needed to recurse into them)
!*/

# Re-ignore generated/binary files that might match above
*.test

# ...and the state files under testdata: those record a real presentation from
# a manual run against someone's Drive, not a fixture any test reads.
testdata/.svg2gslide-*.json
testdata/.svg2gslide.json
